  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/lab/506",
  "definition": "Acceptance or Denial of Claims and Filing of Reports and Payment of Benefits",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-04-01",
  "historyNote": "#2264, eff 1-6-83; ss by #2935, eff 12-27-84; amd by #4854, eff 6-29-90; amd by #5041, eff 1-9-91; ss by #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97 New. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98 New. #6806, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07 New. #9019, eff 11-1-07; amd by #10038, eff 12-1-11; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
